                             helpText(HTML("<b>lmeROTS</b> uses a linear mixed-effects model for differential expression analysis with random effects.<br>
                                           <b>Fixed Effects:</b> Regular predictors like Group, Age, etc.<br>
                                           <b>Random Effects:</b> Variables with repeated measures, hierarchical structure (e.g., Individual, Batch).<br>
                                           <b>Syntax:</b> Random effects use parentheses: <code>(1|Variable)</code> for random intercepts.<br>
                                          <b>Example:</b> Fixed: 'Group', 'Age'; Random: '(1|Individual)' → <code>~ Group + Age + (1|Individual)</code><br>
                                          <b>Note:</b> Requires metadata with sample information and sufficient levels for random effects."))
